### Pagination

```elixir
def list_strategies(user, opts \\ []) do
  page = Keyword.get(opts, :page, 1)
  per_page = Keyword.get(opts, :per_page, 20)

  from(s in Strategy,
    where: s.user_id == ^user.id,
    order_by: [desc: s.inserted_at],
    limit: ^per_page,
    offset: ^((page - 1) * per_page)
  )
  |> Repo.all()
end
