### Documentation Architecture

**Create `ARCHITECTURE.md` in project root:**

```markdown
# Numbers Evolution - Architecture

## System Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    User[User/Browser]
    LV[LiveView]
    Ctx[Contexts Layer]
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    AI[AI Provider]
    
    User --> LV
    LV --> Ctx
    Ctx --> DB
    Ctx --> AI
```

## Contexts

- **Accounts** - User management, authentication
- **Strategies** - Strategy CRUD, AI generation, validation
- **Simulations** - Running simulations, tracking progress
- **Draws** - Historical lottery data, analysis

## Key Processes

### Simulation Flow

1. User triggers simulation (LiveView)
2. LiveView spawns Simulation.Runner GenServer
3. Runner generates numbers in loop
4. Progress updates sent via PubSub to LiveView
5. Results persisted to DB on completion
6. Performance score updated

### AI Strategy Generation Flow

1. User submits prompt (LiveView)
2. Rate limit check (GenServer)
3. Prompt validation & sanitization
4. API call to OpenAI/Claude (with retries)
5. JSON parsing & validation
6. Strategy rules validation
7. Create strategy record or return error

## Supervision Tree

```
Application
├── Repo
├── PubSub
├── Endpoint
├── Telemetry
└── Simulations.Supervisor (DynamicSupervisor)
    └── Multiple Simulation.Runner (GenServer)
```
```

