## Critical MVP Reminders

### Timeline Constraints

- ⏰ **6-week MVP timeline** - every decision should optimize for delivery speed
- 🎯 **Track only Grade I (5+2) wins in MVP1** - other prize tiers post-MVP
- 🤖 **AI is highest risk** - have template fallback ready
- 📊 **3-10 parallel simulations max** in MVP1

### Must-Have Features for MVP1

✅ User authentication (phx.gen.auth)  
✅ Strategy CRUD (manual + AI optional)  
✅ 15+ template strategies seeded  
✅ 100-200 historical draws seeded  
✅ Single simulation with real-time tracking  
✅ Simulation limits (300s timeout OR 1M attempts)  
✅ Strategy ranking by performance  
✅ Number proposal generator  

### Out of Scope for MVP1

❌ All prize tier tracking (II-XII) - only track Grade I (5+2)  
❌ Multi-simulations (3-10 parallel) - MVP2  
❌ Email confirmation  
❌ Password reset  
❌ OAuth  
❌ Advanced analytics/charts  
❌ Stop button for simulations  

### Security Musts

🔒 **Implement from day 1:**
- Password strength validation (min 8 chars, 1 digit)
- AI rate limiting (5 generations/user/day)
- Prompt length validation (max 500 chars)
- User data isolation (always scope queries to current_user)

